    and peripheral soft-reset state (M-8, F-23), the design-time default load and boot lock
    state (M-15);
  - the mission reset assignment: the instance and hart (M-3), the board-level reset scope
    (M-7, M-14) and the permitted software reset sequence (M-14) — owner decisions, agenda C;
